\pard\cf1\f1\fs30\b You're all set\b0\f0\fs19\par
\pard\cf3\fs19\par
\cf1\b KNP Management System\b0\cf3  has been installed. Here are a few tips to get started.\par
\pard\cf1\f1\fs22\b Getting started\b0\f0\fs19\par
\pard\li280\fi-280\bullet\tab Launch the app from the Start Menu or from the desktop shortcut.\par
\pard\li280\fi-280\bullet\tab Sign in with your Kabete Polytechnic account, or choose \b Continue as Guest\b0  to explore.\par
\pard\li280\fi-280\bullet\tab Open \b Explore - Notes Library\b0  to read materials in the built-in PDF viewer.\par
\pard\li280\fi-280\bullet\tab Check \b Timetable\b0  and \b Grades\b0  to see your current schedule and GPA.\par
\pard\cf1\f1\fs22\b Good to know\b0\f0\fs19\par
\pard\cf3 The Windows edition shares the same account and data as the mobile app, so changes made here appear on your phone as well. Push notifications, Google Maps and some mobile-only features are disabled on desktop.\par
\pard\cf1\f1\fs22\b Need help?\b0\f0\fs19\par
\pard\cf3 Project page and issue tracker: \cf4 https://github.com/shelad3/Kabete-Poly\cf3\par
\pard\cf3 To uninstall later, open Settings > Apps > Installed apps, select \b KNP Management System\b0  and choose Uninstall.\par
\pard\cf3\par
\pard\cf3 Click \b Finish\b0  to close this wizard.\par
